# A complete Mermaid block in an answer shows its drawing in place of its code:
# it enlarges and shrinks, shows its source on request, and copies its source.
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[mermaid] [immediate] 流れを図にします"
press 送信
expect "流れを図にしました。" 30000
expect Mermaidをコピー
expect_absent "flowchart LR"
screenshot diagram
press 拡大
expect 縮小
screenshot enlarged
press 縮小
press ソース
expect "flowchart LR"
expect 図を表示
screenshot source
press 図を表示
expect_absent "flowchart LR"
press Mermaidをコピー
expect_clipboard "flowchart LR"
